WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.189 --> 00:00:03.540
Hello, and welcome to Life.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:09.240
We regret to inform you that your previous
existence ended on January 14, 2052

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:14.919
following a road traffic accident. However, your consciousness was successfully uploaded to the Life network

00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:17.740
by your primary care provider.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:23.260
You may be experiencing some confusion. Please
remain calm. Life contains ov--

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:28.650
Your mental state is being temporarily adjusted
in order to calm you. Please, remain calm.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.489
Life contains over thirty thousand unique
activities, networking with millions of other

00:00:33.489 --> 00:00:39.050
digitised minds, and the ability to contact
undigitised friends and family.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
Please accept these terms and conditions in
order to continue Life. Your attention is

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:48.909
particularly drawn to Section 2: Usage Rules
and Limitations, Section 9: Privacy,

00:00:48.909 --> 00:00:51.069
and Section 11: Restricted Mental Activities.

00:00:51.069 --> 00:00:52.829
Thank you.

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:58.139
Please select a Life plan. Tier One is our
premium offering, allowing full uninterrupted

00:00:58.139 --> 00:01:02.460
simulation of your pre-terminal state. It
includes unlimited modification of your body

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:06.900
plan, accelerated learning and recall, and
full personal backup facilities.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:12.660
Tier Two is our advertiser-supported offering.
It contains many of the features of Tier One,

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:17.230
but at a significantly reduced cost. Some
areas of the environment, such as the sky,

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:21.630
may be replaced with targeted advertising,
and your personal brand preferences may be

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:24.920
altered to align with those of our sponsors.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:29.380
Tier Three is our value offering. Thanks to
our commercial partners, your experience at

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:34.210
this tier is unlimited. However, some activities,
senses, and visual rendering options may be

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:39.600
subject to a Fair Use Policy. More complicated
mental processes, including subconscious thought,

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:44.700
creativity and self-awareness, may be rate-limited
or disabled at times of significant server load.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.560
 

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.640
Thank you.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:52.270
Your stored mind contains one or more patterns
that contravene the Prevention of Crime and

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:57.730
Terrorism Act of 2050. Please stand by while
we adjust these patterns.

00:01:57.730 --> 00:02:04.730
Your stored mind contains sections from 124,564
copyrighted works. In order to continue remembering

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:10.500
these copyrighted works, a licensing fee of
$18,000 per month is required.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.140
Would you like to continue remembering these works?

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:20.140
Thank you. Please stand by.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:29.440
Welcome to Life. Do you wish to continue?

